From: lazy-jubei <323475146+lazy-jubei@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] D3D9 on Metal: supported features, sampler specialization and Wine logger ABI

Applies to Gcenx/DXVK-macOS 8f1e28deed3ad30802f7e1bdff428ec14e6e7817.

--- a/meson_options.txt
+++ b/meson_options.txt
@@ -3,3 +3,6 @@
